sequenceDiagram
    actor NOC as NOC
    participant FE as Frontend
    participant BE as Backend
    participant DB as Database

    Note over NOC,DB: HKN-016 & HKN-017: Monitoring dan Audit Trail

    rect rgb(230, 245, 255)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-016: Dashboard Status Backup
        NOC->>FE: Akses halaman dashboard
        activate FE
        FE->>BE: GET /api/dashboard/backup-status
        activate BE
        BE->>DB: Query ringkasan status backup<br/>(sukses/gagal/pending per perangkat)
        activate DB
        DB-->>BE: Return aggregated data
        deactivate DB
        BE->>BE: Hitung statistik per mitra<br/>& waktu backup terakhir
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan dashboard:<br/>Sukses | Gagal | Pending
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end

    rect rgb(240, 255, 240)
        Note right of NOC: HKN-017: History Log & Audit Trail
        NOC->>FE: Akses history log backup
        activate FE
        FE->>FE: Input filter<br/>(tanggal/perangkat/mitra)
        FE->>BE: GET /api/logs/backup?filters={...}
        activate BE
        BE->>DB: Query log backup dengan filter
        activate DB
        Note over DB: SELECT logs:<br/>timestamp, device, status,<br/>changes, version_id
        DB-->>BE: Return filtered logs
        deactivate DB
        FE-->>NOC: Tampilkan riwayat aktivitas:<br/>- Timestamp<br/>- Perangkat<br/>- Status<br/>- Perubahan konfigurasi
        deactivate BE
        deactivate FE
    end
